OL,3,ABrand's barrister refers himself to
OL,4,Aregulator after report he confronted
OL,5,Ajournalist
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand's defence barrister has
OL,8,Freferred himself to the regulator after
OL,9,Freports that he confronted a Sunday
OL,10,FTimes journalist who was involved in a
OL,11,Fmedia investigation into Brand in 2023.
OL,13,FIn a Times and Sunday Times podcast on
OL,14,FThursday, Rosamund Urwin said she
OL,15,Fintroduced herself to Ian Winter KC
OL,16,Foutside court after verdicts were
OL,17,Fdelivered.
OL,19,FShe claimed he responded with a "snarl"
OL,20,Fand said "I hope you're pleased with
OL,21,Fyourself".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
